 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls**:
-- **Basic Mode Transparency**: In Basic mode, casting all voxels results in a fully transparent model if the transfer function maps low values to low opacity, requiring careful transfer function design [S3].
-- **Precision**: Direct voxel access (no interpolation) may cause aliasing or blockiness [S3].
+- **Basic Mode Transparency**: In Basic mode, casting all voxels along the ray trace results in a fully transparent model [S3].
